  "description": "二分定位变体：额外持有每秒 PostToUi 定时器，用于排除「定时器钉住 ALC」",
  "entryAssembly": "HelloPlugin.dll",
  "targetApp": "Harness",
  "minHostVersion": "2026.10.0",
